```
Sound button:
```
const syncSound = () => { btn.textContent = sound.muted ? '🔇':'🔊'; btn.setAttribute('aria-label', ...); }
btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ sound.unlock(); sound.setMuted(!sound.muted); syncSound(); });
```
Careful: sound.unlock() on click starts pad even if muted (master 0). Fine.

Start button: game.start(); and maybe `sound.unlock()`.

again: game.restart().

restart icon: if state playing/dialogue -> game.restart(); toast('Run restarted').

Keyboard 'r'? no.

Loop:
```
let last = performance.now();
function loop(now){ const dt=Math.min(0.05, (now-last)/1000); last=now; game.frame(dt); requestAnimationFrame(loop);} requestAnimationFrame(loop);
```
Visibility: on visibilitychange reset last via flag: set last = performance.now() at each frame anyway clamp handles.

Also set `ui.portrait` canvas.

Game's camera initial scale set in resize; camera position spawn. Title uses camera drift.

Prevent double-tap zoom on iOS: touch-action none; fine.

Splash loading? ground build sync ~100ms; fine.

Write main.js.

